      "value": "We've gotten this suggestion a few times!\nShort response: Scanning avatars isn't free. It, in fact, is quite computationally expensive! It's why we only do it when we need to. The additional performance impact from the system you've proposed would in all likelihood cost orders of magnitude more computational resources than you'd gain.\nImplementation of \"best/worst\" case wouldn't help either-- best case is the whole avatar off, as far as your proposed system is aware. 🤔\nAdditionally, the assets you aren't showing or have the GameObjects off for or etc are still using resources. They, too, aren't free.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
