      "value": "@{5f3046762b921879a5151868|full_name}: You revived my dead post o.o; but yes, this is what i keep saying, the mod that use to exist that stopped the avatar stats, thereby stopping it's scan... kept me from lagging every time someone loaded an avatar. I honestly don't care what a person's avatar has, and if i WANT to know, THEN scan it. I don't need it scanned for me, against my will, when they change into it.",
